 "text": "What if everyone on Earth woke up 10% Nigerian? Day 1. An auntie you've never met calls to ask about your future. Day 3. Your mom now calls you this boy. In public. Week 1. The office party Jalof argument ends in HR. Week 3. Your whole street now argues about whose generator is louder. Month 2. Every wedding lasts three days. You have four this weekend. Month 6. The visa queue reaches the next city. They still say no. Year 1. We have food at home becomes the most said sentence on Earth. Year 5. Every stadium on Earth plays afro beats, even at funerals. Year 10. You finally become a doctor. Your mom asks when you're getting married. What should happen next?"
